{"id": "ee2faba1-bdcf-4c2c-aa0c-c6ed1797fb05", "slug": "lumina-sys-engineered-depth", "title": "Lumina Sys - Engineered Depth", "description": "Lumina Sys Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Lumina Sys - Engineered Depth\"\ndescription: \"Lumina Sys Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#2DE2C5\"\n  secondary: \"#000000\"\n  accent: \"#8FEFE2\"\n  background: \"#2DE2C5\"\n  surface: \"#061C22\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"IBM Plex Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Sora\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"IBM Plex Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Lumina Sys - Engineered Depth\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Samnang Aing (@samnang). Views: 72; favorites: 9; remixes: 1.\nTags: background, animated, webgl, threejs, dither, effect.\n## Overview\nLumina Sys Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.\n\nSYS.12 LUMINA — ENGINEERED DEPTH Engineer the sequence. Online . Computational precision. Atmospheric depth. Systems built for the dark. Initialize core Access terminal Secure Link sys@lumina.io LUMINA SYS Engineering a…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Engineer the sequence. Online .; Protocol; Modules; Data; Comms.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #2DE2C5, secondary #000000, accent #8FEFE2, background #2DE2C5, surface #061C22, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse IBM Plex Mono for display moments and Sora for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use IBM Plex Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Pelagos Sys - Abyssal Intelligence</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r134/three.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Font Pairing: Sora + IBM Plex Mono -->\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@300;400;500&family=Sora:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n    <style>\n        :root {\n            --bg: #020607;\n            --surface: #061011;\n            --surface-deep: #03090A;\n            --text: #F2F7F5;\n            --muted: rgba(242, 247, 245, 0.48);\n            --line: rgba(242, 247, 245, 0.10);\n            --teal: #2DE2C5;\n            --teal-soft: #0F766E;\n            --aqua: #8FEFE2;\n            --deep-blue: #061C22;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;\n        }\n\n        h1,\n        .font-display {\n            font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;\n        }\n\n        .sonar-ring {\n            position: absolute;\n            border-radius: 9999px;\n            border: 1px solid rgba(45, 226, 197, 0.12);\n            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\n            pointer-events: none;\n        }\n\n        .sonar-ring::after {\n            content: \"\";\n            position: absolute;\n            inset: -1px;\n            border-radius: inherit;\n            border: 1px solid transparent;\n            border-top-color: rgba(45, 226, 197, 0.55);\n            border-right-color: rgba(143, 239, 226, 0.18);\n            animation: rotateSonar 14s linear infinite;\n        }\n\n        .sonar-ring:nth-child(2)::after {\n            animation-duration: 21s;\n            animation-direction: reverse;\n            border-top-color: rgba(143, 239, 226, 0.32);\n        }\n\n        .sonar-ring:nth-child(3)::after {\n            animation-duration: 30s;\n            border-top-color: rgba(242, 247, 245, 0.18);\n        }\n\n        @keyframes rotateSonar {\n            to {\n                transform: rotate(360deg);\n            }\n        }\n\n        .sonar-pulse {\n            position: absolute;\n            width: 7px;\n            height: 7px;\n            border-radius: 9999px;\n            background: var(--teal);\n            box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(45, 226, 197, 0.95);\n        }\n\n        .sonar-pulse::after {\n            content: \"\";\n            position: absolute;\n            inset: -10px;\n            border-radius: inherit;\n            border: 1px solid rgba(45, 226, 197, 0.35);\n            animation: sonarPulse 2.4s ease-out infinite;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes sonarPulse {\n            0% {\n                opacity: 0.75;\n                transform: scale(0.35);\n            }\n\n            100% {\n                opacity: 0;\n                transform: scale(1.9);\n            }\n        }\n\n        .scan-sweep {\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 50%;\n            left: 50%;\n            width: 1px;\n            height: 34%;\n            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(45, 226, 197, 0.58), transparent);\n            transform-origin: top center;\n            animation: scanSweep 9s linear infinite;\n            opacity: 0.55;\n            pointer-events: none;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes scanSweep {\n            to {\n                transform: rotate(360deg);\n            }\n        }\n\n        .depth-card {\n            background:\n                linear-gradient(to bottom right, rgba(255,255,255,0.035), transparent),\n                rgba(3, 12, 13, 0.66);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(242, 247, 245, 0.07);\n            box-shadow:\n                0 20px 40px -15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65),\n                0 0 26px rgba(45, 226, 197, 0.08);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(18px);\n            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(18px);\n        }\n\n        .depth-card:hover {\n            border-color: rgba(45, 226, 197, 0.22);\n        }\n\n        .data-line {\n            background: linear-gradient(\n                90deg,\n                transparent,\n                rgba(45, 226, 197, 0.48),\n                rgba(143, 239, 226, 0.18),\n                transparent\n            );\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"relative min-h-screen flex flex-col selection:bg-[#2DE2C5] selection:text-[#020607] antialiased bg-[#020607] text-[#F2F7F5] overflow-x-hidden\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Background -->\n    <canvas id=\"webgl-canvas\" class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 w-screen h-screen z-0 pointer-events-none\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Grain Overlay -->\n    <div style=\"position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 1; pointer-events: none; opacity: 0.08; mix-blend-mode: overlay; background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml;utf8,%3Csvg viewBox=%220 0 200 200%22 xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%3E%3Cfilter id=%22noiseFilter%22%3E%3CfeTurbulence type=%22fractalNoise%22 baseFrequency=%220.85%22 numOctaves=%223%22 stitchTiles=%22stitch%22/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width=%22100%25%22 height=%22100%25%22 filter=%22url(%23noiseFilter)%22/%3E%3C/svg%3E');\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Abyssal Mapping Grid Overlay -->\n    <div style=\"position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 1; pointer-events: none; opacity: 0.14; background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(143,239,226,0.035) 0px, rgba(143,239,226,0.035) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 48px), repeating-linear-gradient(-45deg, rgba(45,226,197,0.025) 0px, rgba(45,226,197,0.025) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 48px);\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Main Wrapper -->\n    <div class=\"relative z-10 flex-grow flex flex-col w-full max-w-[1800px] mx-auto\">\n\n        <!-- Global Vertical Left Decoration Line -->\n        <div class=\"hidden lg:block absolute left-16 top-0 bottom-0 w-[1px] bg-white/10 z-0 pointer-events-none\">\n            <!-- Glowing Teal Dot -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[80px] left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[3px] h-[3px] rounded-full bg-[#2DE2C5]\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 0 12px 2px rgba(45, 226, 197, 0.7);\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Indicator -->\n        <div class=\"hidden lg:flex absolute top-[74px] left-20 items-center gap-2 text-[#2DE2C5] text-xs font-light z-20\">\n            <span>SONAR.07</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Vertical Rotated Text -->\n        <div class=\"hidden lg:block absolute top-[40%] left-16 -translate-x-1/2 -rotate-90 origin-center text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-white/30 uppercase whitespace-nowrap z-20\">\n            PELAGOS — ABYSSAL INTELLIGENCE\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Hero Section -->\n        <main class=\"flex-grow grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 relative\">\n\n            <!-- Left Content Area -->\n            <div class=\"lg:col-span-6 pt-32 pb-24 px-6 lg:pl-32 lg:pr-12 flex flex-col justify-center relative z-20\">\n\n                <!-- Masked Reveal Heading -->\n                <h1 class=\"font-display text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.045em] font-light text-[#F2F7F5] mb-8\">\n                    <div class=\"overflow-hidden inline-flex align-top pb-2\">\n                        <span class=\"reveal-text inline-block translate-y-[110%]\">Decode</span>\n                    </div><br>\n                    <div class=\"overflow-hidden inline-flex align-top pb-2\">\n                        <span class=\"reveal-text inline-block translate-y-[110%]\">the deep.</span>\n                    </div><br>\n                    <div class=\"overflow-hidden inline-flex align-top pb-2\">\n                        <span class=\"reveal-text inline-block translate-y-[110%] flex items-baseline\">\n                            Surface<span class=\"ml-3\">signal</span><span class=\"text-[#2DE2C5] drop-shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(45,226,197,0.85)]\">.</span>\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                </h1>\n\n                <!-- Subheading -->\n                <p id=\"anim-sub\" class=\"text-lg lg:text-xl text-white/50 font-light leading-relaxed max-w-md mb-12 opacity-0\">\n                    Abyssal intelligence for teams mapping complexity, pressure, and hidden systems beneath the surface.\n                </p>\n\n                <!-- Action Buttons -->\n                <div id=\"anim-btn\" class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center gap-8 opacity-0\">\n                    <!-- Primary Button -->\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"group relative inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-[#061011] border border-white/10 text-white/90 text-sm font-light h-14 pl-6 pr-4 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 hover:border-[#2DE2C5]/50 hover:bg-[#071819] hover:shadow-[0_0_24px_-5px_rgba(45,226,197,0.35)]\">\n                        <span class=\"mr-6 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1\">Start mapping</span>\n                        <div class=\"w-[1px] h-full bg-white/10 absolute right-12 top-0 transition-colors group-hover:bg-[#2DE2C5]/30\"></div>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-1 ml-2 text-white/50 group-hover:text-[#2DE2C5]\"></iconify-icon>\n\n                        <!-- Button Sonar Accent -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-[1px] w-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-[#2DE2C5] to-transparent transition-all duration-700 group-hover:w-full\"></div>\n                    </a>\n\n                    <!-- Secondary Link -->\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"group text-sm font-light text-white/70 flex flex-col transition-colors hover:text-white\">\n                        <span class=\"pb-1\">View sonar logs</span>\n                        <div class=\"w-full h-[1px] bg-white/20 group-hover:bg-[#2DE2C5]/70 transition-colors duration-300\"></div>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Down Arrow Indicator -->\n                <div id=\"anim-arrow\" class=\"absolute bottom-12 left-6 lg:left-32 flex flex-col items-center gap-2 opacity-0\">\n                    <div class=\"w-[1px] h-8 bg-gradient-to-b from-white/20 to-transparent\"></div>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:round-alt-arrow-down-linear\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"text-white/40\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Right Visual Area -->\n            <div class=\"lg:col-span-6 relative h-[60vh] lg:h-auto w-full overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center z-10\">\n\n                <!-- Abstract Asset Image repurposed for deep ocean mode -->\n                <img\n                    src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/d14dc069-558a-4c51-8aad-5cc237f9b61d_1600w.jpg\"\n                    alt=\"Abstract Abyssal Core\"\n                    class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 min-w-[150%] min-h-[150%] object-cover object-center opacity-26 scale-x-[-1] rotate-12\"\n                    style=\"filter: grayscale(1) invert(1) sepia(1) hue-rotate(125deg) saturate(4.8) brightness(0.52) contrast(2.35); mix-blend-mode: screen;\"\n                />\n\n                <!-- Subtle Sonar Mapping System -->\n                <div class=\"hidden lg:block absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none\">\n                    <div class=\"sonar-ring left-[52%] top-[48%] w-[520px] h-[520px]\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"sonar-ring left-[52%] top-[48%] w-[360px] h-[360px]\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"sonar-ring left-[52%] top-[48%] w-[220px] h-[220px]\"></div>\n\n                    <div class=\"scan-sweep\"></div>\n\n                    <div class=\"sonar-pulse left-[63%] top-[34%]\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"sonar-pulse left-[42%] top-[58%] scale-75 opacity-70\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"sonar-pulse left-[58%] top-[68%] scale-50 opacity-60\"></div>\n\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-[24%] right-[18%] text-[10px] tracking-[0.24em] uppercase text-white/24\">\n                        Depth / 4021m\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-[24%] left-[26%] text-[10px] tracking-[0.24em] uppercase text-[#2DE2C5]/50\">\n                        Signal preserved\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Floating Dark Command Card -->\n                <div id=\"anim-card\" class=\"absolute bottom-12 right-6 lg:right-24 w-[calc(100%-3rem)] max-w-[420px] depth-card p-8 opacity-0 translate-y-5\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-6\">\n                        <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#2DE2C5] shadow-[0_0_8px_1px_rgba(45,226,197,0.8)]\"></div>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs text-white/50 font-light tracking-wide uppercase\">Signal Channel</span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"mb-6\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-3\">\n                            <span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-white/32\">Transmission clarity</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-[10px] text-[#2DE2C5]\">98.4%</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"h-[2px] bg-white/10 overflow-hidden\">\n                            <div class=\"h-full w-[84%] data-line\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex items-end justify-between border-b border-white/10 pb-4 group cursor-pointer transition-colors hover:border-[#2DE2C5]/35\">\n                        <a href=\"mailto:signal@pelagos.io\" class=\"text-lg text-white/82 font-light transition-colors group-hover:text-white\">\n                            signal@pelagos.io\n                        </a>\n                        <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/5 flex items-center justify-center text-white/50 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-[#2DE2C5]/15 group-hover:text-[#2DE2C5] group-hover:border-[#2DE2C5]/50\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </main>\n\n        <!-- Footer -->\n        <footer class=\"w-full border-t border-white/5 relative z-20 bg-[#020607]/82 backdrop-blur-sm\">\n            <div class=\"px-6 lg:pl-32 lg:pr-24 py-16\">\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-x-8 gap-y-12\">\n\n                    <!-- Branding Col -->\n                    <div class=\"col-span-2 flex flex-col justify-between h-full\">\n                        <div>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 font-light text-sm tracking-widest mb-8\">\n                                <span class=\"text-white/80\">PELAGOS</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-[#2DE2C5]\">SYS</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <p class=\"text-xs text-white/40 font-light leading-relaxed max-w-[220px]\">\n                                Mapping hidden systems through atmospheric intelligence.<br>Built for depth.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"text-xs font-light text-white/30 mt-16 md:mt-0 tracking-wide\">\n                            © 2026 Pelagos Systems. Signal preserved.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Nav Cols -->\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\">\n                        <h4 class=\"text-xs text-white/70 font-light mb-2 uppercase tracking-wider\">Navigation</h4>\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs text-white/40 font-light hover:text-white transition-colors\">Bathymetry</a>\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs text-white/40 font-light hover:text-white transition-colors\">Research Lab</a>\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs text-white/40 font-light hover:text-white transition-colors\">Method</a>\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs text-white/40 font-light hover:text-white transition-colors\">Field Logs</a>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\">\n                        <h4 class=\"text-xs text-white/70 font-light mb-2 uppercase tracking-wider\">Systems</h4>\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs text-white/40 font-light hover:text-white transition-colors\">Sonar Mapping</a>\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs text-white/40 font-light hover:text-white transition-colors\">Pressure Logic</